  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bc698db6e1221934e8011b9c737b57d7, type: 3}
  m_Name: Text_FarmReeve_Shortfall_Venn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Venn? Mind your tongue with that name. He's a Company guard, and a guard at the barn after dark is a guard on duty until somebody shows me otherwise. Accuse a Company man on a newcomer's word and it's the newcomer who gets counted. Bring me real proof, not a stroll in the dark.
